  "faq_1_q": "How is my daily water goal calculated?",
  "faq_1_a": "Your daily water goal is calculated based on your weight, height, age, gender, and activity level using scientific formulas. You can also set a custom goal in Profile settings.",

  "faq_2_q": "How do water reminders work?",
  "faq_2_a": "You can set reminder intervals (30-180 minutes) and choose start/end times. The app will send you notifications during this period to help you stay hydrated.",

  "faq_3_q": "What are streaks and how do they work?",
  "faq_3_a": "Streaks track consecutive days you've reached your daily water goal. Keep drinking water daily to maintain and increase your streak!",

  "faq_4_q": "How can I change the measurement units?",
  "faq_4_a": "Go to Settings → Units and switch between milliliters (ml) and fluid ounces (fl oz). All measurements will update automatically.",

  "faq_5_q": "Can I export my water tracking data?",
  "faq_5_a": "Yes! Go to Settings → Data Management → Export Data. You can share or save your data as a JSON file and import it later.",

  "faq_6_q": "How do achievements work?",
  "faq_6_a": "Complete water tracking milestones to unlock achievements and earn reward points. Track your progress in the Achievements screen.",

  "feature_tracking_title": "Water Tracking",
  "feature_tracking_desc": "Easily log your daily water intake with quick-add buttons (250ml, 350ml, 500ml, 750ml) or enter a custom amount.",

  "feature_reminders_title": "Smart Reminders",
  "feature_reminders_desc": "Set customizable reminder intervals and choose active hours. Never forget to drink water throughout the day.",

  "feature_statistics_title": "Statistics & Insights",
  "feature_statistics_desc": "View your water consumption trends with weekly, monthly, and yearly charts. Track your progress over time.",

  "feature_achievements_title": "Achievements & Streaks",
  "feature_achievements_desc": "Earn achievements and maintain daily streaks by reaching your water goals. Stay motivated with gamification!",

  "feature_profile_title": "Profile & Goals",
  "feature_profile_desc": "Set your personal information and let the app calculate your optimal daily water goal based on your body metrics.",

